      "snippet": {
        "line": 277,
        "text": "InTrueCone p₁ p₂ A C := 0 < A ∧ 2 < A*(1+(C/A)^2) ∧ 2 < p₁ + p₂*(C/A) ∧ A*(1+(C/A)^2) < coneBound (p₁ + p₂*(C/A)) (p₂ - p₁*(C/A)) — the four strict inequalities that the paper's four Ψ_i > 0 assert (a_N > 0, v_N > 2, P_c > 2, and (4.22))"
      }
